  "descriptionHtml": "<div>Rose gold PVD stainless steel case with a brown alligator leather strap. Fixed rose gold PVD stainless steel bezel. Silver dial with rose gold-tone hands and index hour markers. Minute markers around the outer rim. Dial Type: Analog. Date display at the 6 o'clock position. Powermatic 80.111 Automatic movement, containing 23 Jewels, bitting at 28800 vph, and has a power reserve of approximately 80 hours. Scratch resistant sapphire crystal. Pull / push crown. Transparent case back. Round case shape, case size: 39 mm, case thickness: 11.2 mm. Band width: 20 mm. Butterfly clasp. Water resistant at 50 meters / 165 feet. Functions: date, hour, minute, second. Chemin Des Tourelles Series. Casual watch style. Watch label: Swiss Made. Tissot Chemin Des Tourelles Automatic Silver Dial Men's Watch T139.807.36.031.00.</div>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 600;\">Technical Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n    <tbody>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Brand</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Tissot</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Series</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Chemin Des Tourelles</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Model</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">T139.807.36.031.00</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Gender</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Men's</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td st